<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">PILEMON</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga ma Paulo ocoyo bot Pilemon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Pilemon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Pile</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga ma Paulo ocoyo bot</para>
  <para style="mt1">PILEMON</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo ma Lakwena ocoyo waraga man bot Pilemon ma onongo obedo Lakricitayo matek dok gene. Pilemon kitamo ni obedo Lakricitayo me Kolocai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Onecimo onongo obedo opii pa Pilemon ento en oringo woko ki bote. Inge ngwece en orwate ki Paulo ma otite lok me Kwena Maber ki i buc, ci en ojolo Yecu Kricito macalo Lalarne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo dong ocoyo waraga man bot Pilemon wek ojol Onecimo macalo omego i Yecu ento pe macalo opii ma kong olwi ki bote.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Mot bot Pilemon ki jo mukene <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1-3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo oboro ber kit pa Pilemon <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">4-7</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lega bot Onecimo pi Pilemon <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">8-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mot ma dolo te waraga <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">23-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Waraga man oa ki bot an Paulo ma lamabuc pi Kricito Yecu, ki bot ominwa Temceo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Bot Pilemon latic wadiwa ma wamaro <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:17">Kol 4:17</ref> </char></note> gin ki laminwa Apia, ki Arkipo acikari wadiwa, ki jo ma oye Kricito ma gin coke i kanica ma i ot ma meri.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Lubanga Wonwa ki Rwotwa Yecu Kricito omii ki wun kica ki kuc.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mar pa Pilemon ki niyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Apwoyo Lubanga kare ducu ka alwongo nyingi i legana, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />pien abedo kawinyo pi mari ki pi niyeni ma itye kwede ikom Rwotwa Yecu ki bot jo pa Lubanga ducu. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Man omiyo alego ni, kit ribe ma waribe wan kwedi ikom niye odok matek maromo terowa iniang matut ikom gin maber ducu ma watye kwede i Kricito. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Pien mar meri okela yomcwiny, dok ojingo cwinya ba omera, pien ikweyo cwiny jo pa Lubanga.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pido pa Paulo pi Onecimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Pimeno, kadi bed atye ki tekcwiny i Kricito ma onongo omyero aciki acika me tiyo gin mo mamite, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />ento pien amari, omiyo aneno ni ber alegi alega, an Paulo ma acung ma ka Kricito Yecu, ma kombedi bene dong adoko lamabuc pireni. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:9">Kol 4:9</ref> </char></note> Alegi pi latina Onecimo, madong adoko wone i cwiny ki ibuc kany. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Ikare ma okato onongo konye kong obedo peke boti, ento kombedi dong konye dit boti ki bota bene. <verse eid="PHM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Dong acwalo en me dwogo boti eno, en dong odoko macalo dul koma kikome. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Onongo amito ni kong agwok en bota kany, wek omiya kony ma kakari ma kun pud atye i buc pi tito lok me Kwena Maber; <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />ento pe amito ni atim gin mo ma kun nongo in pe iye, wek beri pe obed macalo gin ma kidiyi iye adiya, ento obed pi yeyoni in kikomi.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Gwok onyo man aye gin ma omiyo en yam kong opoke woko kwedi pi kare manok, ni wek dong igame matwal, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />pe dok macalo opii, ento makato opii woko, macalo ominwa ma wamaro. Makatone adada en pire teka, ento ki tung boti pire dong tek tutwal, macalo lakonyi dok omeru bene i Rwotwa.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Kitmeno, ka ingeyo ni an abedo lawoti, omyero igame ikit ma kono igama kwede. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Kace yam otimo gin mo marac ikom in, nyo tye ki banyani mo, kwan magi ducu iwiya. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />An Paulo ki koma aye acoyo lok man ki cinga, abiculi. Pe awaco ni in bene itye ki banyana, en kwoni kikome. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Eyo, omera, amito kony mo ki boti i Rwotwa. Kwe cwinya i Kricito.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Atye ki gen matek ikomi ni ibiworo doga, oweko atye kacoyo boti lok man kun angeyo ni ibitimo makato ma awaco botini. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Medo ikom meno, yuba kicika me butu pa welo, pien atye ki gen ni legawu biweko kimiya botwu.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">Kol 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:12">4:12</ref> </char>
    </note> Epapira lamabuc wadiwa i Kricito Yecu omoti, <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Tic 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:19">19:19</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Tic 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10">2 Tem 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:11">2 Tem 4:11</ref> </char></note> kadi Marako, Arictako, Dema ki Luka lutic wadiwa bene gumoti.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Kica pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito obed kwedwu.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>